I cannot stay. I still have much to do. But take this-- it should help you.\
#LIGHT_GREEN#*He disappears again before you can even reply. A rift opens, to Maj'Eyal... you hope.*#WHITE#", "_t", true) -- 
tDef(25, "Ok...", "_t", true) -- 
