tDef(161, "In a pure display of power, you project a ranged melee attack, doing %d%% weapon damage.\
\9\9If the target is outside of melee range, you have a chance to project a second attack against it for %d%% weapon damage.\
\9\9The second strike chance (which increases with distance) is %0.1f%% at range 2 and %0.1f%% at the maximum range of %d.\
\9\9The range will increase with your Strength.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(171, "Weapon of Wrath", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(216, "Your weapon attacks burn with righteous fury, dealing %d%% of your lost HP as additional Fire damage (up to %d, Current:  %d).\
