\9\9The bonus damage can only occur once per turn.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(226, "Second Life", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(250, "Any attack that would drop you below 1 hit point instead triggers Second Life, deactivating the talent, setting your hit points to 1, then healing you for %d.", "tformat", true) -- 


