tDef(344, "When one of your spells goes critical, you bind glyphs in radius 1 centered on a random target in range %d at the cost of 5 positive and 5 negative energy.\
\9\9Glyphs last for %d turns and cause various effects when an enemy enters their grid.\
\9\9Glyphs will only spawn on enemies that aren't adjacent to an existing glyph.\
