\9\9This increases your movement speed by %d%% and your spell speed by %d%%.\
\9\9You may only have one Hymn active at once.\
\9\9The effects will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(113, "Hymn of Detection", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(209, "Chant the glory of the Moons, granting you stealth detection (+%d power), and invisibility detection (+%d power).\
\9\9You may also attack creatures you cannot see without penalty and your critical hits do %d%% more damage.\
\9\9You may only have one Hymn active at once.\
\9\9The stealth and invisibility detection will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(218, "Hymn of Perseverance", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(278, "Chant the glory of the Moons, granting you %d%% stun, blindness and confusion resistance.\
\9\9You may only have one Hymn active at once.", "tformat", true) -- 
