tDef(25, "Radiance", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(41, "You are so infused with sunlight that your body glows permanently in radius %d, even in dark places.\
\9\9Your vision and body adapt to this glow, giving you %d%% blindness resistance, %d%% light resistance, and %d%% light affinity.\
\9\9The light radius overrides your normal light if it is bigger (it does not stack).\
\9\9", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(50, "Judgement", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(77, "Judgement", "_t", true) -- 
tDef(99, "Fire a glowing orb of light at each enemy within your Radiance.  Each orb will slowly follow its target until it connects, dealing %d light damage to anything else it contacts along the way.  When the target is reached the orb will explode dealing %d light damage in radius 1 and healing you for 50%% of the damage dealt.\
\9\9All targets struck by your Judgement will be blighted by light, reducing saves by %d, reducing critical power by %d%%, and causing light damage received to splash in radius 2 for %d%% damage against all hostile targets for 4 turns.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(106, "Searing Sight", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(158, "Your Radiance is so powerful it burns all foes caught in it, dealing %0.1f light damage to all foes caught inside every turn.\
\9\9Each enemy effected has a %d%% chance of being dazed and blinded by the light for 3 turns. The daze and blind can be applied to each enemy at most once every 7 turns.\
\9\9The damage increases with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(166, "Illumination", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(180, "The light of your Radiance allows you to see that which would normally be unseen and strike that which would normally be protected.\
\9\9All enemies in your Radiance aura have their invisibility and stealth power reduced by %d; all actors affected by illumination have their defense reduced by %d as well as all evasion bonuses from being unseen negated.\
\9\9In addition, your light damage is increased by %d%% and your strikes ignore %d%% of the light resistance of your targets.\
\9\9The invisibility, stealth power, and defense reductions increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 


