tDef(261, "Creates a shadowy copy of a hostile target. The copy will attack its progenitor immediately and lasts for %d turns.\
\9\9The duplicate has %d%% of the target's life, +50%% darkness resistance, -50%% light resistance, and deals 50%% less damage.\
\9\9The duration and life scale with your Cunning.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(271, "Jumpgate Two", "talent name", true) -- 
