tDef(39, "Create an anomaly, reducing your Paradox by %d.  This spell will never produce a major anomaly.\
\9\9Induced Anomalies may not be held by Twist Fate, nor do they cause held anomalies to trigger.  However upon learning Twist Fate you may target Induced Anomalies.\
