tDef(35, "You automatically adjust your Paradox %0.2f points towards your preferred Paradox each turn.\
\9\9While using Spacetime Tuning twice this value will instead be added to the amount you would normally tune.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(42, "Time Shield", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(62, "This intricate spell instantly erects a time shield around the caster, preventing any incoming damage and sending it forward in time.\
\9\9Once either the maximum damage (%d) is absorbed, or the time runs out (%d turns), the stored damage will return as a temporal restoration field over time (5 turns).\
\9\9Each turn the restoration field is active, you get healed for 10%% of the absorbed damage.\
\9\9While under the effect of Time Shield, all newly applied magical, physical and mental effects will have their durations reduced by %d%%.\
\9\9The shield's max absorption will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(72, "Stop", "talent name", true) -- 
