tDef(89, "Fold Warp", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(127, "When you hit with Weapon Folding you have a %d%% chance of dealing an additional %0.2f physical and %0.2f temporal (warp) damage to enemies in a radius of %d.\
\9\9Each target hit may be stunned, blinded, pinned, or confused for %d turns.\
\9\9This effect has a cooldown.  If it triggers while on cooldown it will reduce the cooldown of Fold Gravity and Fold Fate by one turn.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(135, "Fold Gravity", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(175, "When you hit with Weapon Folding you have a %d%% chance of dealing an additional %0.2f physical (gravity) damage to enemies in a radius of %d.\
\9\9Affected targets may also be slowed, decreasing their global speed speed by %d%% for %d turns\
\9\9This effect has a cooldown.  If it triggers while on cooldown it will reduce the cooldown of Fold Fate and Fold Warp by one turn.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(183, "Weapon Folding", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(217, "Folds a single dimension of your weapons (or ammo) upon itself, adding %0.2f temporal damage to your strikes.\
\9\9Additionally you have a %d%% chance to gain 10%% of a turn when your weapons hit.\
\9\9The damage will scale with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(224, "Invigorate", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(243, "For the next %d turns, you recover %0.1f life and talents without fixed cooldowns will have their cooldowns refresh twice as fast as usual.\
\9\9The life regeneration will scale with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(249, "Weapon Manifold", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(284, "You now have a %d%% chance to Fold Fate, Gravity, or Warp into your Weapon Folding damage.\
\9\9\
\9\9Fold Fate: Deals %0.2f temporal damage to enemies in a radius of %d.  Affected targets may lose %d%% physical and temporal resistance for %d turns.\
\9\9Fold Warp: Deals %0.2f physical and %0.2f temporal damage to enemies in a radius of %d.  Affected targets may be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for %d turns.\
\9\9Fold Gravity: Deals %0.2f physical damage to enemies in a radius of %d.  Affected targets will be slowed (%d%%) for %d turns.\
\9\9\
\9\9Each Fold has an eight turn cooldown.  If an effect would be triggered while on cooldown it will reduce the cooldown of the other two Folds by one turn.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(297, "Breach", "talent name", true) -- 
