tDef(164, "Temporal Hounds", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(235, "Upon activation summon a Temporal Hound.  Every %d turns another hound will be summoned, up to a maximum of three hounds. If a hound dies you'll summon a new hound in %d turns.  \
\9\9Your hounds inherit your increased damage percent, have %d%% physical resistance and %d%% temporal resistance, and are immune to teleportation effects.\
\9\9Hounds will get, %d Strength, %d Dexterity, %d Constitution, %d Magic, %d Willpower, and %d Cunning, based on your Magic stat.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(243, "Command Hounds: Blink", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(256, "Temporal Hounds must be sustained to cast this spell.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(275, "You do not have line of sight.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(312, "The spell fizzles!", "logSeen", true) -- 
tDef(329, "Command your Temporal Hounds to teleport to the targeted location.  If you target an enemy your hounds will set that enemy as their target.\
\9\9When you learn this talent, your hounds gain %d defense and %d%% resist all after any teleport.\
\9\9At talent level five, if you're not at your maximum number of hounds when you cast this spell a new one will be summoned.\
\9\9The teleportation bonuses scale with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(337, "Temporal Vigour", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(368, "Your hounds can now survive for up to %d turns after their hit points are reduced below 1.  While in this state they deal 50%% less damage but are immune to additional damage.\
\9\9Command Blink will now regenerate your hounds for %d life per turn and increase their global speed by %d%% for five turns.  Hounds below 1 life when this effect occurs will have the bonuses doubled.\
\9\9When you learn this talent, your hounds gain %d%% stun, blind, confusion, and pin resistance.\
\9\9The regeneration scales with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(376, "Command Hounds: Breathe", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(391, "You must have temporal hounds to use this talent.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(459, "Command your Temporal Hounds to breathe time, dealing %0.2f temporal damage and reducing the three highest stats of all targets in a radius %d cone.\
\9\9Affected targets will have their stats reduced by %d for %d turns.  You are immune to the breath of your own hounds and your hounds are immune to stat damage from other hounds.\
\9\9When you learn this talent, your hounds gain %d%% temporal damage affinity.", "tformat", true) -- 


