tDef(144, "Infects the target with a corrosive worm for 6 turns that reduces blight and acid resistance by %d%% and feeds off damage taken.\
\9\9When this effect ends or the target dies the worm will explode, dealing %d acid damage in a 4 radius ball. This damage will increase by %d%% of all damage taken while infected.\
