tDef(152, "Poison Storm", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(209, "A furious storm of blighted poison rages around the caster in a radius of %d for %d turns.  Each creature hit by the storm takes %0.2f blight damage and is poisoned for %0.2f blight damage over 4 turns.\
\9\9At talent level 2 you have a chance to inflict Insidious Blight, which reduces healing by %d%%.\
\9\9At talent level 4 you have a chance to inflict Numbing Blight, which reduces all damage dealt by %d%%.\
\9\9At talent level 6 you have a chance to inflict Crippling Blight, which causes talents to have a %d%% chance of failure.\
\9\9Each possible effect is equally likely.\
\9\9The poison damage dealt is capable of a critical strike.\
\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 


