tDef(130, "When you kill an enemy, their death forms a cursed magical pattern on the ground. This creates a circle of radius %d which blinds enemies and deals them %0.2f light damage, while giving you %d positive energy per turn. The circle lasts for %d turns.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9The duration of the circle can be increased by a critical hit.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9The blind chance increases with your Spellpower.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9You can activate this talent to draw the pattern in your own blood, creating it underneath you at the cost of %d%% of your maximum life.\
", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(140, "Mark of the Vampire", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(172, "Dooms all enemies within a radius 2 ball for 20 turns. Each time an affected target uses a talent, it takes %0.2f physical damage as its life is drawn out. In addition, any bleed applied to the target will have its power increased by %d%%.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.\
\9\9\9\9\9\9\9The chance to apply will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
