tDef(231, "Create a barrier that siphons hate from you at the rate of 0.2 a turn. The barrier will deflect 50%% of incoming damage with the force of your will, up to %d damage. The barrier charges at a rate of 1/%d of its maximum charge per turn.\
\9\9In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by %d%% (currently: %d%%)\
