tDef(200, "Any direct damage that exceeds %d%% of your maximum life has the excess damage converted to a shallow wound that bleeds over the next %d turns. This bleed cannot be resisted or removed, but can be reduced by Bloodstained. Extremely powerful hits (more than %d%% of your max life) are not fully converted.\
\
#{italic}#You can't just die. That would be too easy.#{normal}#", "tformat", true) -- 


