section "mod-tome/data/talents/gifts/earthen-power.lua"

tDef(20, "Stoneshield", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(45, "The first time you take damage each turn, you regenerate %d%% of the damage dealt as mana (up to a maximum of %0.2f) and %d%% as equilibrium (up to %0.2f).\
\9\9Increases Physical Power by %d, increases damage done with shields by %d%%, and allows you to dual-wield shields.\
\9\9Also, all of your melee attacks will perform a shield bash in addition to their normal effects.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(52, "Stone Fortress", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(66, "When you use your Resilience of the Dwarves racial power your skin becomes so tough that it even absorbs damage from non-physical attacks.\
\9\9Non-physical damage is reduced by %d%% of your total armour value (ignoring hardiness).\
\9\9While this effect is not active, half of it is still applied against foes entangled by your stone vines.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(74, "Shards", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(89, "Sharp shards of stone grow from your shields.\
\9\9When you are hit in melee, you will get a free attack against the attacker with the shards doing %d%% shield damage (as Nature).\
\9\9This effect can only happen once per turn and is not affected by counterstrike.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(97, "Eldritch Stone", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(121, "Creates a shield of impenetrable stone around you for %d turns, absorbing up to %d damage.\
\9\9Your equilibrium will increase by twice the damage absorbed.\
\9\9When the effect ends, all equilibrium above minimum will be converted to mana in a storm of arcane energy and the cooldown of your Block is reset.\
\9\9The storm inflicts Arcane damage equal to the converted equilibrium (maximum %d) against everyone around you in a radius %d.\
\9\9Also while resting you will passively regenerate %0.2f mana each turn.\
\9\9The shield strength will increase with Willpower", "tformat", true) -- 


