\9\9Reloading does not break stealth.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2734, "Sweep", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2743, "You require two weapons to use this talent.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(2757, "You cannot use Sweep without dual wielding!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(2792, "Attack your foes in a frontal arc, doing %d%% weapon damage and making your targets bleed for %d each turn for %d turns.\
\9\9The bleed damage increases with your main hand weapon damage and Dexterity.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2799, "Empower Poisons", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2836, "Reduces the duration of all poisons on the target by 50%%, but increases their damage by %d%%.\
\9\9The effect increases with your Cunning.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2843, "Willful Combat", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2861, "For %d turns, you put all your will into your blows, adding %d physical power to each strike.\
\9\9The effect will improve with your Cunning and Willpower stats.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2868, "Deadly Strikes", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2902, "You hit your target, doing %d%% damage. If your attack hits, you gain %d armor penetration (APR) for %d turns.\
\9\9The APR will increase with your Cunning.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2909, "Sticky Smoke", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2933, "Throws a vial of sticky smoke that explodes in radius %d on your foes, reducing their vision range by %d for 5 turns.\
\9\9Creatures affected by smoke bomb can never prevent you from stealthing, even if their proximity would normally forbid it.\
\9\9Use of this will not break stealth.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2941, "Switch Place", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(2968, "Terrain prevents #Source# from switching places with #Target#.", "logCombat", true) -- 
tDef(2983, "Using a series of tricks and maneuvers, you switch places with your target.\
\9\9Switching places will confuse your foes, granting you Evasion (50%%) for %d turns.\
\9\9While switching places, your weapon(s) will connect with the target; this will not do weapon damage, but on hit effects of the weapons can trigger.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(2991, "Cripple", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3024, "You hit your target, doing %d%% damage. If your attack connects, the target is crippled for %d turns, losing %d%% melee, spellcasting and mind speed.\
\9\9The chance to land the status improves with Accuracy, and the status power improves with Cunning.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3031, "Nimble Movements", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3033, "@Source@ dashes quickly!", "_t", true) -- 
tDef(3044, "You can not do that currently.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3055, "You cannot dash through that!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3076, "Quickly and quietly dash your way to the target square, if it is not blocked by enemies or obstacles. This talent will not break Stealth.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3081, "Hide in Plain Sight", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3100, "You cannot be stealthy with such heavy armour on!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3127, "You have learned how to be stealthy even when in plain sight of your foes.  You may attempt to enter stealth regardless of how close you are to your enemies, but success is more likely against fewer opponents that are farther away.\
\9\9Your chance to succeed is determined by comparing %0.2f times your stealth power (currently %d) to the stealth detection of all enemies (reduced by 10%% per tile distance) that have a clear line of sight to you.\
\9\9You always succeed if you are not directly observed.\
\9\9This resets the cooldown of your Stealth talent, and, if successful, all creatures currently following you will lose track of your position.\
\9\9You estimate your current chance to hide as %0.1f%%.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3137, "Unseen Actions", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3157, "You are able to perform usually unstealthy actions (attacking, using objects, ...) without breaking stealth.\9 When you perform such an action while stealthed, you have a chance to stay hidden.\
\9\9Success is more likely against fewer opponents and is determined by comparing %0.2f times your stealth power (currently %d) to the stealth detection (reduced by 10%% per tile distance) of all enemies that have a clear line of sight to you.\
\9\9Your base chance of success is 100%% if you are not directly observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.\
\9\9You estimate your current chance to maintain stealth as %0.1f%%.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3166, "Hack'n'Back", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3198, "You hit your target, doing %d%% damage, distracting it while you jump back %d squares away.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3204, "Mobile Defence", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3216, "Whilst wearing leather or lighter armour, you gain %d%% Defense and %d%% Armour hardiness.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3222, "Light of Foot", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3232, "You are light on your feet, handling your armour better. Each step you take regenerates %0.2f stamina, and your fatigue is permanently reduced by %0.1f%%.\
\9\9At level 3 you are able to walk so lightly that you never trigger traps that require pressure.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3240, "Strider", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3254, "You literally dance around your foes, increasing your movement speed by %d%% and reducing the cooldown of Hack'n'Back, Rush, Disengage and Evasion by %d turns.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3260, "Charm Mastery", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3275, "Your cunning manipulations allow you to use charms (wands, totems and torques) more efficiently, reducing their cooldowns by %d%%.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3281, "Piercing Sight", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3289, "You look at your surroundings with more intensity than most people, allowing you to see stealthed or invisible creatures.\
\9\9Increases stealth detection by %d and invisibility detection by %d.\
\9\9The detection power increases with your Cunning.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3297, "Precision", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3312, "You cannot use Precision without dual wielding!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3325, "You have learned to hit the right spot, increasing your armor penetration by %d when dual wielding.\
\9\9The Armour penetration bonus will increase with your Dexterity.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3331, "Momentum", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3340, "You require two melee weapons to use this talent.", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3345, "You cannot use Momentum without dual wielding melee weapons!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3360, "When dual wielding, increases attack speed by %d%%, but drains stamina quickly (-6 stamina/turn).", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3365, "Defensive Throw", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3395, "#Source# slams #Target# into the ground!", "logCombat", true) -- 
tDef(3398, "#Source# throws #Target# to the ground!", "logCombat", true) -- 
tDef(3405, "#Source# misses a defensive throw against #Target#!", "logCombat", true) -- 
tDef(3414, "When you avoid a melee blow while unarmed, you have a %d%% chance to throw the target to the ground.  If the throw lands, the target will take %0.2f damage and be dazed for 2 turns, or %0.2f damage and be stunned for 2 turns if the target is grappled.  You may attempt up to %0.1f throws per turn.\
\9\9The chance of throwing increases with your Accuracy, the damage scales with your Physical Power, and the number of attempts with your Strength and Dexterity.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3421, "Roundhouse Kick", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3450, "Attack your foes in a frontal arc with a roundhouse kick, which deals %0.2f physical damage and knocks your foes back 4 grids. This will break any grapples you're maintaining\
\9\9The damage improves with your Physical Power.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3457, "Bone Nova", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3477, "Fire bone spears in all directions, hitting all foes within radius %d for %0.2f physical damage, and inflicting bleeding for another %0.2f damage over 5 turns.\
\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3483, "Shadow Ambush", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3514, "%s resists the shadow!", "logSeen", true) -- 
tDef(3522, "You reach out with shadowy vines toward your target, pulling it to you and silencing it for %d turns and dazing it for 2 turns.\
\9\9The chance to hit improves with your Accuracy.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3529, "Ambuscade", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3547, "Not enough space to invoke your shadow!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(3551, "Shadow of %s", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3552, "A dark shadowy form in the shape of %s.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3609, "You take full control of your own shadow for %d turns.\
\9\9Your shadow possesses your talents and stats, has %d%% life and deals %d%% damage, -30%% all resistances, -100%% light resistance and +100%% darkness resistance.\
\9\9Your shadow is permanently stealthed (%d power), and all melee damage it deals is converted to darkness damage.\
\9\9The shadow cannot teleport.\
\9\9If you release control early or if it leaves your sight for too long, your shadow will dissipate.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3619, "Shadow Leash", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3647, "For an instant, your weapons turn into a shadow leash that tries to grab the target's weapon, disarming it for %d turns.\
\9\9The chance to hit improves with your Accuracy.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3654, "Dismay", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3665, "Each turn, those caught in your gloom must save against your Mindpower or have an %0.1f%% chance of becoming dismayed for %d turns. When dismayed, the first melee attack against the foe will result in a critical hit.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3670, "Shadow Empathy", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3702, "You are linked to your shadows for %d turns, diverting %d%% of all damage you take to a random shadow.\
\9\9Effect increases with Mindpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3709, "Circle of Blazing Light", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3746, "Creates a circle of radius %d at your feet; the circle lights up affected tiles, increases your positive energy by %d each turn and deals %0.2f light damage and %0.2f fire damage per turn to everyone else within its radius.  The circle lasts %d turns.\
\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3753, "Blur Sight", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3775, "The caster's image blurs, granting a %d bonus to Defense.\
\9\9The bonus will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3782, "Cold Flames", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3830, "cold flames", "_t", true) -- 
tDef(3961, "Cold Flames slowly spread from %d spots in a radius of %d around the targeted location. The flames deal %0.2f cold damage, and have a chance of freezing.\
\9\9Damage improves with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(3967, "Quicken Spells", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(3987, "Reduces the cooldown of all spells by %d%%.", "tformat", true) -- 


