tDef(114, "Warding Weapon", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(129, "Assume a defensive mental state.\
\9\9For one turn, you will fully block the next melee attack used against you with your telekinetically-wielded weapon and then strike the attacker with it for %d%% weapon damage.\
\9\9At talent level 3 you will also disarm the attacker for 3 turns.\
