\9\9The chance for the attack to daze increases with you Physical Power, but it is considered a magical attack and thus is resisted with spell save, rather than physical save.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(172, "Eldritch Slam", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(183, "You cannot use Eldritch Slam without a shield!", "logPlayer", true) -- 
tDef(205, "Slam your shield on the ground creating a shockwave.\
