tDef(185, "Crush 5 alchemist gems into dust to mark impassable terrain next to you. You immediately enter it and appear on the other side of the obstacle, up to %d grids away.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(191, "Stone Touch", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(227, "Touch your foe and turn it to stone for %d turns.\
\9\9Stoned creatures are unable to act or regen life, and are very brittle.\
\9\9If a stoned creature is hit by an attack that deals more than 30%% of its life, it will shatter and be destroyed.\
\9\9Stoned creatures are highly resistant to fire and lightning, and somewhat resistant to physical attacks.\
\9\9At level 3 the touch will become a beam.\
