\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(73, "Body of Stone", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(127, "You root yourself into the earth, and transform your flesh into stone.  While this spell is sustained, you may not move, and any forced movement will end the effect.\
\9\9Your stone form and your affinity with the earth while the spell is active has the following effects:\
\9\9* Reduces the cooldown of Earthen Missiles, Pulverizing Auger, Earthquake, and Mudslide by %d%%.\
\9\9* Grants %d%% Fire Resistance, %d%% Lightning Resistance, %d%% Acid Resistance, and %d%% Stun Resistance.\
\9\9Resistances scale with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(137, "Earthquake", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(178, "Causes a violent earthquake that deals %0.2f physical damage in a radius of %d each turn for %d turns, and potentially stuns any and all creatures it affects.\
\9\9The damage will increase with your Spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(185, "Crystalline Focus", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(224, "Concentrate on maintaining a Crystalline Focus, increasing all your physical damage by %0.1f%% and ignoring %d%% physical resistance of your targets.\
\9\9Also raises your physical and magical saves by %d.", "tformat", true) -- 


