tDef(136, "A #LIGHT_BLUE#wave of icy water#LAST# erupts from the ground!", "logSeen", true) -- 
tDef(158, "A wall of water rushes out from the caster with an initial radius of 1, increasing by 1 per turn to a maximum radius of %d, doing %0.2f cold damage and %0.2f physical damage to all inside, as well as knocking back targets each turn.\
\9\9The tidal wave lasts for %d turns.\
