\9\9The power will increase with your Spellpower.\
\
\9\9#AQUAMARINE#Ice storm:#LAST#\
\9\9%s", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(210, "Ice Storm", "talent name", true) -- 
tDef(248, "A furious ice storm rages around the caster, doing %0.2f cold damage in a radius of 3 each turn for %d turns.\
\9\9It has a 25%% chance to freeze damaged targets.\
