tDef(189, "(Cooldowns)", "_t", true) -- 
tDef(191, "Surround yourself with a malevolent aura that stores damage you deal.\
\9\9Whenever you have stored %d damage of one type you unleash a powerful blast at a random enemy dealing %d damage of that type in radius %d and applying one of the following effects:\
\
\9\9Physical:\9\9Slows combat, mind, and spell speed by 20%%.\
\9\9#GREEN#Acid:#LAST#  Deals %d acid damage each turn for 5 turns (%d total).\
\9\9#DARK_GREEN#Blight:#LAST#  Deals %d blight damage each turn for 5 turns and reduces strength, constitution, and dexterity by %d.\
\9\9#GREY#Darkness:#LAST#  Reduces damage dealt by %d%% for 5 turns.\
\9\9#LIGHT_STEEL_BLUE#Temporal:#LAST#  Slows global action speed by %d%% for 5 turns.\
\9\9#ORANGE#Mind:#LAST#  Confuses (power %d%%) for 5 turns.\
\
\9\9Each effect can only happen once per 10 player turns.  This does not count as a typical cooldown.\
\9\9The damage and effect power increase with your Cunning, the threshold with your level, and the apply power is the highest of your mind or spell power.\
\9\9%s", "tformat", true) -- 
