tDef(334, "%s surges with #LIGHT_GREEN#natural#LAST# power!", "logSeen", true) -- 
tDef(353, "Surround yourself with an elemental aura that stores damage you deal.\
\9\9Whenever you have stored %d damage of one type you unleash a powerful blast at a random enemy dealing %d damage of that type in radius %d and granting you one of the following effects:\
\
\9\9Physical:\9\9Cleanses 1 physical debuff and grant immunity to physical debuffs for 2 turns.\
\9\9#PURPLE#Arcane:#LAST#\9\9Increases your mind and spell action speeds by 30%% for 3 turns.\
\9\9#LIGHT_RED#Fire:#LAST#\9\9Increases all damage dealt by %d%% for 3 turns.\
\9\9#1133F3#Cold:#LAST#\9\9Turns your skin into ice for 3 turns increasing armor by %d and dealing %d ice damage to attackers.\
\9\9#ROYAL_BLUE#Lightning:#LAST#\9Increases your movement speed by %d%% for 2 turns.\
\9\9#YELLOW#Light:#LAST#\9\9Reduces all cooldowns by 20%% for 3 turns.\
\9\9#LIGHT_GREEN#Nature:#LAST#\9\9Cleanses 1 magical debuff and grant immunity to magical debuffs for 2 turns.\
\
\9\9Each effect can only happen once per 10 player turns.  This does not count as a typical cooldown.\
\9\9The damage and some effect powers increase with your Cunning and the threshold with your level.\
\9\9%s", "tformat", true) -- 
