\9\9Any time you are the target of a dispel effect the aether strengthens around you, protecting you from the dispel and any further ones for 6 turns and unsustaining this spell.\
\9\9While undisturbed the layer of aether provides you with 40 raw spellpower.", "tformat", true) -- 
