%s\
", "tformat", true) -- 
tDef(124, "Your study of arcane forces has let you develop a new way of applying your aptitude for trapping and poisons.\
\
\9\9You gain 1.0 mastery in the Cunning/Poisons and Cunning/Trapping talent trees.\
\9\9Your Venomous Strike talent cooldown is reduced by 3.\
